This class was my senior seminar. We completed 3 major projects:


First Project - In this project, I created a sentence generator by creating a transition matrix to predict the most likely word based on the previous two words. 

Second Project - In this project, we I created a second sentence generator, this time using vectors to quatize each word, and use a clustering algorithim to determine similar words to predict the next word in a sentence.

Final Project - In this project, I created a transformer model able to classify the category of a given jepordy question. While the accuracy was only 12% on the testing data, when examining the topics guessed by the model, in many cases the topic was a reasonable guess given the question.


Each project is contained in a zip file with a document or notebook containing more detail on the process and results of each project. 
